==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has finally surpassed 63 million downloads worldwide!!<br>
A limited-time campaign will be held to commemorate this!<br>
During the event period, open the "The Battle Cats" app for a {{Color|#FF0000|'''daily 20 Cat Food'''}} present!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''The event period is scheduled for September 13th (11:00) to September 27th, 2021 (10:59)!'''}}<br>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●「Treasure Fest☆Festival」is held!'''}}<br>
A limited-time Treasure Festival will be held throughout the period, with a significant increase in Treasure drop rates!<br>
During the campaign period, it will be held on {{Color|#008000|'''even-numbered days (9/14, 9/16, 9/18, 9/20, 9/22, 9/24, 9/26)'''}} in the{{Color|#008000|'''"Japan Arc"'''}} and {{Color|#00BAFF|'''odd-numbered days (9/13, 9/15, 9/17, 9/19, 9/21, 9/23, 9/25, 9/27)'''}} in the {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Future Arc"'''}}!<br>
Plus, it will also be held in the {{Color|#0000FF|'''"Cosmos Arc"'''}}！<br>
The {{Color|#0000FF|'''"Cosmos Arc"'''}} Treasure Festival will be held on {{Color|#0000FF|'''9/15, 9/18, 9/21, 9/24, 9/27'''}}!<br>
<small>※"Japan Arc" and "Future Arc" Treasure Festivals will appear after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 1, "Cosmos Arc" Treasure Festivals will appear after clearing "Future Arc" Chapter 1.</small>

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Daily Cat Food present！'''}}<br>
During the event period, open the "The Battle Cats" app for a
{{Color|#FF0000|'''daily 20 Cat Food'''}} present!'''<br>
Play the game every day, GET Cat Food!

